  Opportunity --> Choice["Life Voice/视频 Agent 自己考虑是否长期想看"]
  Choice --> Gate["原 agentFollowEnabled/额度/去重/有效 UID/实时关系门禁"]
  Selected --> Gate
  Gate -->|"鱼鱼真正选择；不强制"| Follow["bili_follow_creator：平台成功回执"]
